        <mxCell id="tod_box" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;tod.py: tod_update(screen, row, settings)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  1. CPS520.01 → place claim_no → ENTER&lt;br/&gt;  2. Select draft 01 → &quot;X&quot; @ (29,9) → condition list&lt;br/&gt;  3. For each condition where TOD=&apos;99&apos; or &apos;00&apos;:&lt;br/&gt;     CPS910.01 → place TOD @ (5,60) → ENTER&lt;br/&gt;  fail → set row[MACRO_STATUS], return False → SKIP" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#00695c;strokeColor=#004d40;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;align=left;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1110" y="582" width="370" height="96" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- CPS520.01 — initial entry -->
        <mxCell id="scr520_hdr" parent="1" value="SCREEN: CPS520.01   (Claim Search / List)" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#37474f;strokeColor=#263238;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="580" y="690" width="400" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scr520_body" parent="1" value="utils.py: place_value(claim_no, 8, 15)&lt;br/&gt;utils.py: remove_value(9, 15)&lt;br/&gt;utils.py: remove_value(12, 15)&lt;br/&gt;utils.py: send_enter(screen)" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#455a64;strokeColor=#263238;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;align=left;" vertex="1">
